$!	PATCHED-ASSIGN: point the STOIC logical names and symbols at the
$!	Phase 6 patched copy in [.WORK.PATCHED], as WORK-ASSIGN does for
$!	the Phase 2 rebuild.
$ ASSIGN DUA1:[USERS.CLAUDE.WORK.PATCHED.KERNEL] SAO$KERNEL
$ ASSIGN DUA1:[USERS.CLAUDE.WORK.PATCHED.STOIC]  SAO$STOIC
$ ASSIGN DUA1:[USERS.CLAUDE.WORK.PATCHED.RED]    SAO$RED
$ STOIC :== $SAO$STOIC:STOIC
$ RED :== $SAO$RED:RED RED
$ CALC :== $SAO$RED:RED FLODEF
